1
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:15,517
That winter, the snow closed every road, and the tower had no bell.

2
00:00:19,150 --> 00:00:22,231
So every house gave what metal it had.

3
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:37,175
The boy gave his compass, the one thing that always guided him home.

4
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:54,761
When it rang, the snow stopped to listen.
